<title>POLAND: Polish wheat/rye prices rise,barley flat last week.</title>
<headline>Polish wheat/rye prices rise,barley flat last week.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish wholesale wheat and rye prices rose last week while barley prices remained flat, the Agriculture Ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p>Polish farm auction prices (average/zloty per quintal)</p>
<p>Product    wk to Sep 14  pvs week   six-wk range  yr/yr change</p>
<p> Wheat	63 zl/q	 61 zl/q    61-67 zl/q	75 pct</p>
<p> Rye	  42 zl/q	 40 zl/q    38-44 zl/q	68 pct</p>
<p> Barley     52 zl/q	 53 zl/q    52-58 zl/q	63 pct</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
